	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">A defect represents a physical problem with a UUT. When a defect exist on a UUT, the UUT is considered defective and needs to be repaired.  A defect may be caused by a defective component, or by other causes (ex: component missing, solder missing, etc).</Property>
